{
  "job_B3.3.17.3_20251003_114702": {
    "chunk_text": "De Sancto Martino Confessore.. Men \u00fea leofestan, magon we nu hwylcumhwego wordum asecgan be \u00fe\u00e6re arwyr\u00f0nesse \u00feysse halgan W\u00e6s he Gode swi\u00f0e gecoren on his \u00feeawum. W\u00e6s he in Pannana \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00f0e in woruld cumen, in Arrea \u00f0am tune. W\u00e6s he hw\u00e6\u00f0re in Italia afeded, in Ticinan \u00fe\u00e6re byrig. W\u00e6s he for worulde swi\u00f0e godre gebyrde. W\u00e6ron his f\u00e6der & his modor buta h\u00e6\u00f0en. W\u00e6s his f\u00e6der \u00e6rest cyninges \u00feegn, & \u00fea \u00e6t nehstan ge\u00feah \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s tribunus, \u00fe\u00e6t is ealdorman \u00dea sceolde he, sanctus Martinus, nyde beon sona on his giogo\u00f0hade on geferr\u00e6ddenne cyninges \u00feegna, Nalles \u00fe\u00e6t he his on \u00feam willan on \u00feam woruldfolgo\u00f0e w\u00e6re, ac he w\u00e6s on Godes \u00feeowdome mycle & \u00fea he w\u00e6s X wintre, \u00fea tihton hine his yldran to woruldfolgo\u00f0e, & \u00fea fleah he to Godes cirican & \u00dea he w\u00e6s XV wintra, \u00fea genyddon hie hine, his yldran, to \u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde w\u00e6pnum onfon, & on \u00d0a w\u00e6ron \u00fereo gear \u00e6r his fulwihte \u00fe\u00e6t he woruldlicu w\u00e6pen w\u00e6g. & he hine hw\u00e6\u00f0re wi\u00f0 eallum \u00feam healicum synnum geheold, \u00fea \u00f0e woruldmen fremmia\u00f0 in H\u00e6fde he mycle lufan & ealle swetnesse to \u00e6lcum men, & he w\u00e6s ge\u00feyldig & eadmod & gemetf\u00e6st on & \u00feeah \u00fee he gyt on l\u00e6",
